  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946053",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-70903",
      "knowledge_point_id": "cef7fc21-23f4-5d6a-a208-9963ef23c784",
      "knowledge_point": "Calculating the Slope of the Tangent Line of a Logarithmic Function at a Point",
      "problem": "Given that $y=3\\operatorname{log}⁡x+{x}^{3}-4$, find the slope of the tangent at $x=3.$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the slope of the tangent at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+3{x}^{2}\\,.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=3} & ={(\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+3{x}^{2})|}_{x=3} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{3\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+3\\cdot {3}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+27\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}-9",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+3",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+9",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{9}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}-3",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+27",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "knowledge_point_source_id": 3630,
      "difficulty": "easy",
