  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946345",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-18688",
      "knowledge_point_id": "f7578c48-cc9e-5170-8ffe-5ebee6580677",
      "knowledge_point": "Solving a System Containing Decimals in One Equation",
      "problem": "Find the solution of the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "To get rid of the decimals, we multiply the second equation by $10,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 &  \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5 & |\\,\\times 10\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 15a+5b=25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the first equation is already solved for $b:$\n\n$$\nb=2a-1\n$$\n\nNow, to find the value of $a,$ we can substitute $b=2a-1$ into the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15a+5(2a-1) & =25 \\\\ 15a+10a-5 & =25 \\\\ 25a & =30 \\\\ a & =\\frac{30}{25} \\\\ a & =1.2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $a=1.2$ into the  first equation to get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =2(1.2)-1 \\\\  & =2.4-1 \\\\  & =1.4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the solution to the system of equations is $a=1.2$ and $b=1.4.$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "a=1.2,\\,b=1.4",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "a=-1.2,\\,b=0.4",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "a=0.2,\\,b=1.7",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "a=0.5,\\,b=-1.4",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "a=1.5,\\,b=2.4",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "difficulty": "easy",
